ba-Roth</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Muller</surname><given-names>OA</given-names></name><name><surname>Schopohl</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Arginine stimulates growth hormone secretion by suppressing endogenous somatostatin secretion</article-title><source>J Clin Endocrinol Metab</source><year>1988</year><volume>67</volume><fpage>1186</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2903866</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Isidori</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Lo Monaco</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Cappa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A study of growth hormone release in man after oral administration of amino acids</article-title><source>Curr Med Res Opin</source><year>1981</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>475</fpage><lpage>81</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6790230</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Suminiski</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Robertson</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Goss</surname><given-names>FL</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Acute effect of amino acid ingestion and resistance exercise on plasma growth hormone concentration in young men</article-title><source>Int J Sport Nutr</source><year>1997</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>48</fpage><lpage>60</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9063764</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Colombani</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Bitzi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Frey-Rindova</surname><given-names>P</given-