creatine intake is beneficial to muscle performance and pharmacokinetic considerations</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>1997</year><volume>83</volume><fpage>2055</fpage><lpage>2063</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9390981</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Volek</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Duncan</surname><given-names>ND</given-names></name><name><surname>Mazzetti</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Putukian</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Performance and muscle fiber adaptations to creatine supplementation and heavy resistance training</article-title><source>Med Sci Sports Exerc</source><year>1999</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>1147</fpage><lpage>1156</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10449017</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Juhn</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Tarnopolsky</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Oral creatine supplementation and athletic performance: A critical review</article-title><source>Clin J Sport Med</source><year>1998</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>286</fpage><lpage>297</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9884793</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Walker</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Creatine: biosynthesis, regulation, and function</article-title><source>Adv Enzymol Relat Areas Mol Biol</source><year>1979</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>177</fpage><lpage>242</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">386719</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stead</surname><